{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/强化蓄能重炮","pageid":8189,"revid":20187,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E8%93%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8D%E7%82%AE&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E8%93%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8D%E7%82%AE&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E8%93%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8D%E7%82%AE&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>强化蓄能重炮</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.BC.BA.E5.8C.96.E8.93.84.E8.83.BD.E9.87.8D.E7.82.AE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"强化蓄能重炮\"><b>强化蓄能重炮</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 穿云箭.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/fc/qc7i7vjaw7otuu8rystgp2k6pzwbyrb.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%A9%BF%E4%BA%91%E7%AE%AD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/fc/qc7i7vjaw7otuu8rystgp2k6pzwbyrb.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%A9%BF%E4%BA%91%E7%AE%AD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/fc/qc7i7vjaw7otuu8rystgp2k6pzwbyrb.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />强化蓄能重炮\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-30\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合；<br />✦对场上当前生命值最低的非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">召唤角色</span>]的敌人标记，准备<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合，对其造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">360%</font>物理伤害，并使地形格变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">圣域</font></span>]。攻击时，无视护盾、援护防御。<br />✦标记目标自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内，每多<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>名友军，造成伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，最多降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">强袭时刻</font></span>]，效果：若击败目标，施加场上所有敌人<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">魂飞魄散</font></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-30 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/52/4jauwqa2si38xe2r0krmvvmmtd60q3a.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-30_0.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/52/4jauwqa2si38xe2r0krmvvmmtd60q3a.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-30_0.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/52/4jauwqa2si38xe2r0krmvvmmtd60q3a.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-30_0.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"202\" data-file-height=\"202\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%88%98%E8%BD%A6%E2%80%9D\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/第七灾厄“战车”\"><img alt=\"第七灾厄“战车” 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/bwku7gchj1aabegqzy1yel7hrbmzo9w.png/75px-%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%88%98%E8%BD%A6%E2%80%9D_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/bwku7gchj1aabegqzy1yel7hrbmzo9w.png/113px-%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%88%98%E8%BD%A6%E2%80%9D_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/bwku7gchj1aabegqzy1yel7hrbmzo9w.png/150px-%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%88%98%E8%BD%A6%E2%80%9D_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></div>\n</div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022152906\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.468 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.640 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9616/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 165168/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16641/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  612.582      1 模板:技能\n100.00%  612.582      1 -total\n  5.97%   36.575      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n  4.96%   30.364      5 模板:中括号介绍\n  2.17%   13.321      1 模板:面包屑\n  1.67%   10.227      1 模板:魔物图\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:8